{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"apache","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Apache config","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Apache config (.htaccess .htpasswd).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"apache","name":"Apache config","extensions":[".htaccess",".htpasswd"],"grammar":"grammars/apache.json","filenames":["httpd.conf","apache2.conf",".htaccess"],"lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Apache config","path":"snippets/apache.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/apache.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*</?[A-Za-z]+\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"%\\\\{[A-Z_]+\\\\}|\\\\$\\\\d\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\[[A-Z,=]+\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:DirectoryIndex|AllowOverride|ErrorDocument|RedirectMatch|RewriteEngine|DocumentRoot|RewriteBase|RewriteCond|RewriteRule|ServerAdmin|LoadModule|ServerName|AuthType|Redirect|SetEnvIf|Include|Options|Require|Satisfy|Header|SetEnv|Alias|Allow|Order|Deny)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:FollowSymLinks|Indexes|None|Off|All|On)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/apache.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Rewrite to index.php\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rw\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"RewriteEngine On\",\n      \"RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f\",\n      \"RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d\",\n      \"RewriteRule ^ index.php [L]\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Front controller rewrite\"\n  },\n  \"Force HTTPS\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"https\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"RewriteEngine On\",\n      \"RewriteCond %{HTTPS} off\",\n      \"RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://%{HTTP_HOST}/$1 [R=301,L]\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Redirect to HTTPS\"\n  },\n  \"Deny access\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"deny\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Require all denied\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Deny all\"\n  },\n  \"Cache static files\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cache\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<FilesMatch \\\"\\\\\\\\.(css|js|png|jpg|svg|woff2)\\\\$\\\">\",\n      \"\\tHeader set Cache-Control \\\"max-age=31536000, public\\\"\",\n      \"</FilesMatch>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Cache headers\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Apache config\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Apache config.\n\n## Files\n\n`.htaccess`, `.htpasswd`, `httpd.conf`, `apache2.conf`, `.htaccess`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `rw` | Front controller rewrite |\n| `https` | Redirect to HTTPS |\n| `deny` | Deny all |\n| `cache` | Cache headers |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}